The St. Thomas More School Fighting Knights athletic program is committed to:
- Providing a safe, healthy and educational environment for all student athletes;
- Teaching the fundamentals of each sport in order that our players may develop their skills as well as learn some valuable life lessons about commitment, sportsmanship and teamwork which will benefit them both on and off court/field.

- Building self esteem and confidence;
- Encouraging students to participate in competitive sports at the high school level. We also encourage parental involvement by way of coaching, volunteering their time or even helping us out with equipment needs/donations.  The athletic program is an important part of our student's life experience and we hope it will help them develop a lifelong healthy lifestyle!
